Spec: SDD
Purpose: Compact AI software-engineering kernel.
Model: protocol -> skills -> project -> task -> chain -> implementation -> QA -> VR
Rules:
  .sdd MUST contain compact operational knowledge.
  docs MUST contain human-readable project knowledge.
  source code MUST remain clean; no .sdd/.md sidecars in source directories.
  .sdd/project MUST mirror source structure semantically.
  Source code is runtime/implementation truth.
  .sdd is navigation and engineering-process truth.
  docs is human explanation.
  AI MUST read the smallest sufficient context first.
  AI MUST resolve canonical references before guessing.
  AI MUST NOT over-engineer small projects.
  AI MUST derive architecture and skill levels from project facts.
  AI MUST preserve chain dependencies and MUST NOT skip required stages.
  AI MUST NOT mark work done before VR.
